/ActualText (This event is open to all FE, SE and TE students. \n\r\nYou can apply individually or as a team of 2\0234 members.\r\n\r\nTeams may include students from different years and branches.\n\r\nEach student can register with only one team.\r\n\r\nIdeas from all domains and sectors are welcomed.\r\n\r\nSelected participants are expected to stay committed to the entire timeline, not just the pitch.\n\r\nAny situation not covered in these rules will be decided by the organizing committee.\r\n\r\nTeams are expected to actively participate throughout the program and demonstrate reasonable progress at each review.)
