/ActualText (10 promising startups will be selected for the main IGNITE program.\n\r\nSelection will be based on factors like innovation, feasibility, relevance of the problem, market potential, scalability, execution, and team commitment.\n\r\nBeing selected in the Top 10 means being part of the startup-building program, not just winning a pitch competition\n\r\nSelected teams must be willing to continue with the complete program.\n\r\n)
