/ActualText (A total grant of \2711,00,000 will be available for the selected Top 10 teams.\n\r\nThe grant amount for each team will be decided based on the startup-related expenses and bills submitted by the team.\n\r\nThe grant can be used for genuine startup development needs such as prototyping, materials, software, testing, hosting, and other related expenses.\n\r\n)
