/ActualText (Selected participants will receive guidance through periodic sessions with industry experts, entrepreneurs, mentors, and VCs, subject to availability.\n\r\nThere may also be opportunities for industry or startup ecosystem visits and other external interactions.\n\r\nParticipants are expected to attend all scheduled mentorship, review, and evaluation sessions.\n\r\nRegular progress is expected throughout the program.\n\r\nRelevant mentor feedback should be used to improve the product and business model.\n\r\nRepeated absence, inactivity, or lack of reasonable progress may affect continuation in the program.)
