/ActualText (The idea and work created by the team will remain with the team members, as per institute policy.\n\nMake sure your submission does not copy or knowingly use someone else\031s work or intellectual property.\n\nIf your idea is based on existing work, technology, or intellectual property, mention it clearly in your submission.\n\nThe I&E Cell may use team/startup names, photos, and non-confidential project details for IGNITE-related documentation and promotion.)
